{
  "__inputs": [],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "grafana",
      "id": "grafana",
      "name": "Grafana",
      "version": "10.2.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  ],
  "uid": "efe-msw-tls",
  "title": "EFE Meta-Swarm \u2014 TLS & Cert Rotation",
  "description": "mTLS handshake health, cert expiry monitoring, rotation events.",
  "tags": [
    "efe",
    "meta-swarm",
    "pr19",
    "tls",
    "security"
  ],
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "name": "Cert reloads",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "#FF780A",
        "expr": "changes(efe_meta_swarm_tls_reload_at_seconds[5m]) > 0",
        "tagKeys": "role",
        "titleFormat": "TLS reload ({{role}})"
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "prometheus_ds",
        "type": "datasource",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "Prometheus",
          "value": "Prometheus"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "cluster",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Cluster",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(efe_meta_swarm_tls_handshake_total, cluster)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "env",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Environment",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(efe_meta_swarm_tls_handshake_total{cluster=~\"$cluster\"}, env)",
        "refresh": 1,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": false,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "role",
        "type": "custom",
        "label": "Role",
        "query": "server,client",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true
      },
      {
        "name": "runbook_base",
        "type": "constant",
        "query": "https://efe.example.com/runbook/meta-swarm",
        "current": {
          "text": "https://efe.example.com/runbook/meta-swarm",
          "value": "https://efe.example.com/runbook/meta-swarm"
        },
        "hide": 2,
        "skipUrlSync": true,
        "label": "runbook base URL"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Days until next cert expiry",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(min(efe_meta_swarm_tls_cert_expiry_seconds) - time()) / 86400",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "d",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 7
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 30
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 60
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Cert expiry table",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 18,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(efe_meta_swarm_tls_cert_expiry_seconds - time()) / 86400",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "job": true,
              "instance": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "cert_name": "Cert",
              "subject_cn": "Subject CN",
              "Value": "Days until expiry"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "left"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 7
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 30
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 60
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Days until expiry"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-background",
                  "mode": "gradient"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "TLS handshake p95 by role",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (role, le) (rate(efe_meta_swarm_tls_handshake_duration_seconds_bucket{role=~\"$role\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 / {{role}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.05
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.2
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "TLS handshake errors by failure_reason",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (failure_reason) (rate(efe_meta_swarm_tls_handshake_total{result!=\"ok\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{failure_reason}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Handshake success rate (1h)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(efe_meta_swarm_tls_handshake_total{result=\"ok\"}[1h])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(efe_meta_swarm_tls_handshake_total[1h])), 0.001)",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 99.5
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 99.9
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "TLS reload failures (24h)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(efe_meta_swarm_tls_reload_total{result=\"error\"}[24h]))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 3
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "TLS reload events",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${prometheus_ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "efe_meta_swarm_tls_reload_at_seconds",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "role": "Role",
              "Value": "Last reload (epoch s)"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "TLS docs + runbook",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Linked alert** : [A4 TLSCertExpiringSoon](${runbook_base}/RB_PR19_MSW4.md) \u2014 fires < 7 days.\n\n**Cert rotation** : cert-manager auto-renews at 2/3 of cert lifetime. If A4 fires, check :\n```\nkubectl describe certificate <cert-name> -n efe\n```\n\n**Failure reasons (closed taxonomy)** : `handshake_timeout`, `san_mismatch`, `cert_invalid`, `tls_version_unsupported`, `other`.\n"
      }
    }
  ]
}